            {
              "_key": "000000000000",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Tesoros Ocultos de Ras Sudr: Guía de maravillas naturales sin parangón"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000c",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000003",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000002"
              ],
              "text": "Ras Sudr"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", una serena escapada en la costa "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000005"
              ],
              "text": "del Mar Rojo"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000007",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", es un mosaico de impresionantes atracciones naturales."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000008",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000009",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Cada lugar ofrece una mezcla única de belleza, aventura y curación."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "He aquí algunos lugares de visita obligada que encapsulan la esencia de esta encantadora región."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-58907",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000005",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mar_Rojo",
              "newTab": true
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000e",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Hamamat Faraón: Una escultura tallada por la naturaleza"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000027",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "A sólo 115 km del Túnel Ahmad Hamdi, Hamamat Pharaon es una maravilla a la "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000011",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000010"
              ],
              "text": "que las palabras apenas pueden hacer"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000012",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " justicia."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000013",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000014",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " El paisaje aquí es nada menos que etéreo, "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000016",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "con rocas delicadamente talladas que forman una"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000017",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " escultura natural de inmensa belleza."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000018",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000019",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Aunque es un lugar de relajación y meditación, Hamamat "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000001a"
              ],
              "text": "Pharaon también atrae a los"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " aventureros."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " La zona está madura para la "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000020",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000001f"
              ],
              "text": "exploración"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000021",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", desde el alpinismo hasta la acampada fuera de lo común."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000022",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000023",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Sumérgete en los cautivadores colores de las montañas y los valles, cada uno de los cuales cuenta una "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000025",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000024"
              ],
              "text": "historia del tiempo"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000026",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " y la naturaleza. "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000010",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/blog/cosas-que-hacer-en-sharm-el-sheikh",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001a",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/guia-de-viaje-de-kom-ombo/los-speos-de-horemheb/",
              "newTab": false
